{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And a woman to her sister.</b> With her sister, like אל חלליהם in Joshua." "<b>You shall not take to afflict.</b> Do not cause that they both be rivals (צרורות) during their lives — living widows, each one of them binding her fellow. As in the expression ותהיינה צרורות אלמנות חיות." "<b>To uncover her nakedness.</b> That of the second, together with the first during her lifetime." "<b>Upon her.</b> With her, like על שדה הארץ יחשב."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:13:13.201437753Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}